# Purpose

This document captures the engineering principles discovered throughout **Project Orion**.

Unlike language syntax or framework-specific features, these principles are technology-independent. They apply to Python, databases, Linux, cloud platforms, DevOps, and software engineering in general.

Every milestone in Orion may introduce one or more new principles. Over time, this document will become the engineering philosophy behind the project.

