# Principle 3 — Main Orchestrates; Modules Implement

## Statement

The main application should coordinate work rather than perform it.

## Why?

The entry point should clearly describe the application's workflow while delegating implementation details to specialized modules.

## Orion Example

```python
inventory = {
    "os": get_os_info(),
    "cpu": get_cpu_info(),
}

write_inventory(inventory)
```

The orchestration is obvious without reading implementation details.

## Benefits

- Readable program flow
- Easier refactoring
- Clear separation of concerns
- Better scalability

